      <description><![CDATA[<p style="float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;"><img src="https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/article-covers/2026/10/01M47E98M7WF0617YMCEA467EH/laundering.jpg" alt="Chinese crime network laundered over $1B for Lazarus: ZachXBT" class="type:primaryImage"></p><p>ZachXBT says he infiltrated the network by posing as a customer, gaining information that helped trace funds from the $1.5 billion Bybit hack. </p>]]></description>
